        "created_at": "2026-10-17T01:01:36.847Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi — I build production n8n (and Make/Zapier) automations and light AI agents for small teams.</p>\n<p>Typical work:<br>\n• Lead capture → AI qualify → CRM / Slack / Sheets<br>\n• Form / webhook → processing → notifications + error alerts<br>\n• Email triage, invoice/PDF extraction, simple support bots<br>\n• Multi-step workflows with clean documentation and handover</p>\n<p>How I work:<br>\n• Fixed price agreed before I start<br>\n• You get the workflow export + short plain-English notes<br>\n• PayPal accepted<br>\n• Small jobs usually 1–4 days after access</p>\n<p>Indicative ranges:<br>\n• Simple single workflow: $150–300<br>\n• Medium (multi-step + AI step / CRM): $350–750<br>\n• Larger systems quoted after a short brief</p>\n<p>Reply here or DM with what you’re doing manually today and I’ll send a clear plan + fixed price.<br>\nPayPal: <a href=\"mailto:Chijiokeonyenorah@gmail.com\">Chijiokeonyenorah@gmail.com</a></p>",
